<title>PHILIPPINES: Urbancorp Q1 net at 28.367 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Urbancorp Q1 net at 28.367 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Urbancorp Realty Developers Inc said on Monday it posted a net income of 28.367 million pesos in the first quarter of the year.</p>
<p>Total income amounted to 43.243 million pesos, with proceeds from the sales of property reaching 38.757 million pesos.</p>
<p>Expenses totalled 14.928 million pesos.</p>
<p>-- MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
</text>
